  "body": "Act fast!  2 lots under contract and Lots 1 & 2 are available.\r\n\r\nDiscover a collection of four brand-new, freehold homes, meticulously crafted for modern life in a sought-after, established neighborhood. Designed with your family's evolution in mind, this is the perfect setting for creating lasting memories-from quiet work-from-home days to festive gatherings and everything in between.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Lot 1-4 :  4 bedrooms 2.5 bathrooms floor area 140-144m2.    \r\n\r\n* Title issued and CCC on the way.\r\n\r\n* Corner site each house has its own driveway adding convenience for your vehicle\r\n\r\n* Four generous bedrooms. The master suite includes a built-in / Walk-in wardrobe and an ensuite for added convenience.\r\n\r\n* Two beautifully fully tiled bathrooms including an ensuite.\r\n\r\n* Open-plan kitchen equipped with premium Bosch appliances, including a gas cooktop.\r\n\r\n* Two air-conditioning (in the living room and master bedroom) ensure a comfortable climate no matter the season.\r\n\r\n* An internal access garage and low-maintenance section make daily life easy for busy professionals and families.\r\n\r\nContact us today to request further information. This is an executive family living at its best.",
